     9549     gds-rec = recid (ub.goods).
     9550     run ref/gds-form.w ( input parparentproc
     9551                         ,input 'ПРОСМОТР':U
     9552                         ,input ?
     9553                         ,input ?
     9554                         ,input ?
     9555                         ,input-output gds-rec).
     9556     apply "entry" to br-dtl in frame d-out-doc.
     9557     return no-apply.
     9558   end.
     9559   define variable vss-include-info50 as character format "X(65)" no-undo initial "@(#)$Workfile$ $Revision$".
     9560   on INS of frame d-out-doc anywhere do:
