    12826            view-as alert-box question buttons yes-no update varlog.
    12827   if varlog then
    12828   do transaction :
    12829      for each ub.doc-line where ub.doc-line.doc-code = t-doc.doc-code:
    12830        ub.doc-line.fact-qnty = 0.
