    12943   on choose of menu-item m-ptrl-1 in menu m-ptrl do:
    12944     apply "row-leave" to browse br-dtl.
    12945     run cr-rvs-doc in this-procedure
    12946       ( input parparentproc
    12947        ,input t-doc.doc-code
    12948       ) no-error .
